-- Check and modify constraints
-- =========================================================
SELECT * FROM get_constraints('animal.cat') WHERE constraint_type IN ('PRIMARY KEY', 'UNIQUE', 'FOREIGN KEY');
 constraint_catalog | constraint_schema |    constraint_name    |   table_catalog    | table_schema | table_name  | constraint_type | is_deferrable | initially_deferred | enforced | nulls_distinct 
--------------------+-------------------+-----------------------+--------------------+--------------+-------------+-----------------+---------------+--------------------+----------+----------------
 contrib_regression | _backing          | animal__cat_pkey      | contrib_regression | _backing     | animal__cat | PRIMARY KEY     | NO            | NO                 | YES      | 
 contrib_regression | _backing          | cat_cat_owner_id_fkey | contrib_regression | _backing     | animal__cat | FOREIGN KEY     | NO            | NO                 | YES      | 
